---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy, Nesso">
  <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-foreground/60 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: February 7, 2026</p>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-foreground/80 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect only the information you explicitly provide:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Email address and name when you create an account</li>
        <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> Names, phone numbers, and email addresses of people you add</li>
        <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> Your personal favorites and settings</li>
        <li><strong>Connection history:</strong> Interaction logs you manually record</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">2. What We Don't Collect</h2>
      <p>Nesso is built with a privacy-first approach. We do <strong>not</strong>:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
        <li>Access your phone contacts or address book</li>
        <li>Read your text messages, call logs, or emails</li>
        <li>Track your location</li>
        <li>Sync data from your phone in the background</li>
        <li>Sell or share your data with third parties for advertising</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>Your information is used solely to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
        <li>Provide and maintain the Nesso service</li>
        <li>Generate personalized message suggestions</li>
        <li>Calculate connection levels and reminders</li>
        <li>Process payments through Stripe (for paid subscriptions)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">4. Data Storage & Security</h2>
      <p>
        Your data is stored securely using industry-standard encryption. We use cloud infrastructure
        with row-level security policies ensuring that only you can access your data. All data transmission
        is encrypted via HTTPS.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Authentication:</strong> Google and Apple Sign-In for secure login</li>
        <li><strong>Payments:</strong> Stripe for subscription processing</li>
        <li><strong>AI:</strong> AI-powered message suggestions (your data is not used for model training)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> Export all your data at any time from Settings</li>
        <li><strong>Delete:</strong> Permanently delete your account and all associated data</li>
        <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Download your data in JSON format</li>
        <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Update or modify your personal information at any time</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">7. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Your data is retained as long as your account is active. When you delete your account,
        all associated data is permanently removed from our systems. We do not retain backups
        of deleted user data.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">8. Age & Accessibility</h2>
      <p>
        Nesso is designed for users of all ages. We believe staying connected to the people who
        matter is important at every stage of life.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material changes
        by posting the updated policy on this page with a new "Last updated" date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, please reach out to us
        at <a href="mailto:nesso.team@gmail.com" class="text-foreground font-medium underline hover:text-foreground/80">nesso.team@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</LegalLayout>
